{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"standards\": [\n    {\n      \"std\": \"1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"从试探亲近、被看见后的不安、重新放松，到希望互相依靠、接受感情的不确定，人物的行动、原因和情绪变化都能顺着看下来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"感受大多紧贴人物当下的处境，能补出亲近、舍不得、害怕失去和重新放松等体验，没有持续割裂成两套叙述。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"有问题\",\n      \"note\": \"S11有同一种心口疼痛反复表达的情况，局部可以精简，但没有造成主线理解障碍。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"有问题\",\n      \"note\": \"整体基本自然，但个别搭配不顺、表达偏书面或像站在人物外面解释，第一次扫读会有轻微卡顿。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"5\",\n      \"verdict\": \"不可评估\",\n      \"note\": \"未提供DAG定稿原文，无法核对定稿内容是否完整保留。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"6\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"多数感受保留了具体的声音、身体感觉和画面，比笼统的情绪词更有辨识度，细腻度整体足够。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"7\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"主要情节和情绪转折都有关键词放大，重点明确，结合各屏停留时间，没有明确证据表明关键文字来不及读到或故事主干扫不出来。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"quote\": \"像一件想了很久的话，到了嘴边先沉默几秒\",\n      \"why\": \"「一件话」搭配不自然，普通人平常不会这样说。意思能猜到，但扫到这里会轻微卡顿，影响口语感。\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"std\": \"3\",\n      \"quote\": \"刺眼到让人想流泪，胸口反而被压得发痛；熟悉的温柔还在，可知道它有多珍贵后，心里反而更容易发疼；欢喜就压得他心口发疼。\",\n      \"why\": \"同一屏连续三次表达欢喜中带着心口疼痛，第一处已经给出强烈的身体感受，后两处又重复说明相近的情绪结果。局部有不必要的重复，删并一处不会损失人物的情绪转折。\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"跨段\",\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"quote\": \"S11「前面悬置的期待似乎终于得到满足，但还不是结束」；S14「进入终结句才真正松下来、轻下来」\",\n      \"why\": \"「悬置的期待」「终结句」偏书面或音乐分析式表达，不太像普通人在讲感受。尤其前一句像站在人物外面解释音乐和情绪的关系，观众需要自行转换成日常语言才能顺畅理解。\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a81ebde0-304b-4b77-a10c-cd2eaabafaf6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T093931520058Z", "elapsed_seconds": 464.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T09:47:16.243239+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cf26f3dda10710633957971c6bd899472d0ac310d1dd196956f2c275231ddf1b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T093931520058Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e064cfddd2cb1018fa5e7089ad73fb8134b9632e2a123845a2afeda025e9878f"}}}
